cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Antigravity_Codex_ClaudeCode_DeepSeekHarness: 面向科学计算与工程研发的四客户端配置与验证工具"
message: "If you use this software or workflow specification in academic research or engineering projects, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Xinyu
repository-code: "https://github.com/Xinyu-Li-1997/Antigravity_Codex_ClaudeCode_DeepSeekHarness"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24293507"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24293507
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Shared engineering rules (R0-R11), deterministic session lifecycle hooks,
  read-only review subagents, lexical grounding checks, and cross-client
  headless verification workflows across Google Antigravity, OpenAI Codex,
  Claude Code, and DeepSeek Harness for scientific computing, CAE, CFD, FEA,
  numerical PDE solvers, HPC, and high-reliability software engineering,
  implemented purely on the Python 3.11+ standard library across Windows, WSL2,
  and Linux. 本仓库所载研究成果由作者独立完成，仅接受国家留学基金管理委员会（CSC，学号 202506280162，批准文号 留金选[2025]37号）资助，未接受任何其他单位或个人任何形式的资助、项目、资源、设施、行政或机构性支持。
keywords:
  - scientific-computing
  - computer-aided-engineering
  - computational-fluid-dynamics
  - finite-element-analysis
  - numerical-pde
